# =============================================================
# Monorepo 统一忽略规则
# 各服务目录下仍保留自己的 .gitignore，这里只做兜底，防止
# 依赖、构建产物、日志和真实密钥被误提交。
# =============================================================

# ---------- 依赖与构建产物 ----------
**/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/dist-ssr/
frontend/coverage/
frontend/.eslintcache
admin/dist/
admin/coverage/
**/__screenshots__/
application-service/target/
agent-service/.venv/
agent-service/venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.coverage
**/coverage.xml
**/htmlcov/

# ---------- 环境变量与密钥 ----------
# 真实配置一律不提交，只保留 .env.example
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
# Solo 模式生成的本地密钥文件
/.env.solo
!**/.env.example

# ---------- IDE / 系统 ----------
.idea/
.vscode/
**/.screenshots/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# ---------- 日志与临时文件 ----------
*.log
logs/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# ---------- 本地部署产物 ----------
deploy/backups/
deploy/logs/
deploy/*.tar.gz

# ---------- 服务内部文档 ----------
# 三个服务的 docs 仅本地保留，不进入 Git 克隆；根 docs/ 仍正常跟踪
frontend/docs/
application-service/docs/
agent-service/docs/

# ---------- impeccable 技能运行时产物 ----------
# 保留共享产物：config.json、live/config.json、design.json、
# surfaces/*.md、critique/*.md；其余截图、会话与缓存不作为交付物提交
# impeccable-ignore-start
# Ephemeral output, runtime state, and per-dev overrides.
# The **/ prefix covers .impeccable at the repo root or in a nested workspace.
**/.impeccable/config.local.json
**/.impeccable/hook.cache.json
**/.impeccable/hook.pending.json
**/.impeccable/*.png
**/.impeccable/review/
**/.impeccable/questions/
**/.impeccable/live/server.json
**/.impeccable/live/sessions/
**/.impeccable/live/previews/
**/.impeccable/live/annotations/
**/.impeccable/live/cache/
**/.impeccable/live/manual-edit-apply-transaction.json
**/.impeccable/live/manual-edit-events.jsonl
**/.impeccable/live/manual-edit-evidence/
**/.impeccable/live/pending-manual-edits.json
**/.impeccable/live/deferred-svelte-component-accepts.json
**/.impeccable/live/*.png
# impeccable-ignore-end

# ---------- 技能附带的平台二进制 ----------
# 单文件近 19MB，仅本地保留，避免仓库体积膨胀
.trae/skills/impeccable/scripts/bin/

# ---------- taste-skill 技能运行时产物 ----------
# 设计方向、浏览器审查截图与滚动场景快照均为本地中间产物，不作为交付物提交
**/.taste-skill/

# ---------- Stage 8 硬件数据治理产物 ----------
# 原始数据许可未核实前，全量派生产物只保留在本地；版本库只提交
# schema/、manifest/、samples/ 与 docs/quality 下的统计报告（ADR 0013）
data/pc-config/master/
data/pc-config/pools/
data/pc-config/export/
data/pc-config/staging/
